{"91:1:1":"By the sun","91:1:2":"and its brightness","91:2:1":"And the moon","91:2:2":"when","91:2:3":"it follows it","91:3:1":"And the day","91:3:2":"when","91:3:3":"it displays it","91:4:1":"And the night","91:4:2":"when","91:4:3":"it covers it","91:5:1":"And the heaven","91:5:3":"constructed it","91:6:1":"And the earth","91:6:3":"spread it","91:7:1":"And (the) soul","91:7:3":"proportioned it","91:8:1":"And He inspired it","91:8:2":"(to distinguish) its wickedness","91:8:3":"and its righteousness","91:9:2":"he succeeds","91:9:4":"purifies it","91:10:2":"he fails","91:10:4":"buries it","91:11:1":"Denied","91:11:3":"by their transgression","91:12:1":"When","91:12:2":"(was) sent forth","91:12:3":"(the) most wicked of them","91:13:1":"But said","91:13:3":"(the) Messenger","91:13:4":"(of) Allah","91:13:5":"(It is the) she-camel","91:13:6":"(of) Allah","91:13:7":"and her drink","91:14:1":"But they denied him","91:14:2":"and they hamstrung her","91:14:3":"So destroyed","91:14:5":"their Lord","91:14:6":"for their sin","91:14:7":"and leveled them","91:15:2":"He fears","91:15:3":"its consequences"}
